          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n   1. The applicant should be a farmer.\n   1. The applicant should belong to any of the following districts of Bihar : Kishanganj, Araria, Supaul, Purnia and Katihar.\n   1. The applicant must have a minimum land area of 2 acres.\n   1. The applicant must be registered on the DBT portal.\n\n"
